    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "世界安静了。\n这次没有声音。\n取而代之的是画面——像老电影的胶片，一帧一帧闪过："
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen walks out the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "为什么你不出来追我？",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "key",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "一个女孩站在雨里，头发贴在脸上，手里攥着一把钥匙。她在哭。面前的男人——年轻时的顾深——站在门内，手搭在门框上，没有走出去。\n*\"为什么你不出来追我？\"*"
  },
